      "worked": "Since $A$ and $B$ are independent, $P(A\\cap B)=P(A)P(B)$.\n$$\\begin{align*}P(A\\cup B)&=P(A)+P(B)-P(A)P(B)\\\\0.8&=0.2+P(B)-0.2P(B)\\\\0.6&=0.8P(B)\\\\P(B)&=\\frac{0.6}{0.8}\\\\P(B)&=0.75\\end{align*}$$",
